      ],
      "text": "TB treatment for people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        167.92044067382812,
        520.2328491210938,
        180.39393615722656
      ],
      "text": "12. It is recommended that TB patients who are living with HIV should receive at least the same duration of daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        179.32040405273438,
        462.6051940917969,
        191.7938995361328
      ],
      "text": "TB treatment as HIV-negative TB patients .   (strong recommendation, high certainty of evidence) (17)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        197.57522583007812,
        514.8073120117188,
        210.04872131347656
      ],
      "text": "13. People living with HIV with TB and histoplasmosis coinfection should receive TB therapy according to WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        208.97518920898438,
        407.4953918457031,
        221.4486846923828
      ],
      "text": "treatment guidelines  .  (conditional recommendation; very-low-certainty evidence) (20)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        76.7854995727539,
        228.8612060546875,
        309.198486328125,
        242.0511932373047
      ],
      "text": "Integrated delivery of care for HIV-associated TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        249.90719604492188,
        511.80450439453125,
        262.3807067871094
      ],
      "text": "14. In settings with a high burden of HIV and TB, TB treatment may be provided for people living with HIV in HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        75.08470153808594,
        261.3073425292969,
        514.5169067382812,
        273.7808532714844
      ],
      "text": "care settings where a TB diagnosis has also been made  .  (strong recommendation, very-low-certainty evidence) (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        293.056396484375,
        194.8868865966797,
        312.63140869140625
      ],
      "text": "2.3.1\t Background",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.43115234375,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Early initiation of TB treatment and ART among people with both TB and HIV is critical for reducing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.4002685546875,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "mortality and improving TB treatment outcomes. People living with HIV who receive a diagnosis of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4212646484375,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "TB should receive a WHO-recommended TB treatment regimen. This section covers timing of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.4300537109375,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "treatment, as well as provision of integrated care. WHO recommendations on treatment regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4367065429688,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "for people with drug-susceptible TB and MDR-TB can be found in  WHO consolidated guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4405517578125,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and in  on tuberculosis. Module 4: treatment – drug-susceptible tuberculosis treatment (17) WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        409.4154357910156,
        524.4301147460938,
        423.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "consolidated guidelines on tuberculosis. Module 4: treatment – drug-resistant tuberculosis treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.38232421875,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": ". The timing of ART initiation in people with presumed or diagnosed TB is covered in Section 3.2.  (16)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        461.0564270019531,
        354.8603515625,
        480.6314392089844
      ],
      "text": "2.3.2\t Summary of evidence and rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        493.2064208984375,
        457.7778625488281,
        507.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 12: Duration of daily TB treatment for people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.3900146484375,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was first put forward in 2010 and is considered valid in the guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.404541015625,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "update of 2017 and in the current consolidated guidelines on drug susceptible TB treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.3935546875,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review and meta-analysis of six randomized controlled trials (RCTs) and 21 cohort",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.3506469726562,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "studies provided pooled estimates of failure, relapse and death by duration of rifampicin, and daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.407958984375,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "intensive phase versus intermittent throughout  . The systematic review revealed a marked and  (40)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.3837280273438,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "significant reduction in failure and relapse in the study arms in which some or all study participants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.447509765625,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "received ART. In a regression model, treatment failure or relapse was 1.8–2.5 times more likely with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4014282226562,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "intermittent rather than daily dosing in the intensive phase. Compared with 8 or more months",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.3956909179688,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "of rifampicin, 2-month rifampicin regimens carried a 3-fold higher risk of relapse, and 6-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4356079101562,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "regimens carried a 2.2-fold higher risk. Extending treatment beyond 6 months is recommended",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.3903198242188,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "by some expert groups in certain persons living with HIV and the meta-analysis showed that this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.4014892578125,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "is associated with significantly lower relapse rates. However, several other considerations were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4002685546875,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "given greater weight. Separate regimens for people with TB living with or without HIV would be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.39599609375,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "very challenging in operational terms and could create stigma. Other potential harms of extending",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.412353515625,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "treatment are acquired resistance to rifampicin, and a longer period during which ART options are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86630249023438,
        717.3823852539062,
        299.0426330566406,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "limited (because of ART–rifampicin interactions).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661994934082,
        801.2599487304688,
        51.106197357177734,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "20",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.4342041015625,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.2599487304688,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
